T1  - UF-CDDFM: A unified framework for code defect detection using multi-modal inputs and few-shot learning
AU  - Zhou, Xianglu
AU  - Cui, Tianxiang
AU  - Zhu, Xiaoyan
AU  - Wang, Jiayin
AU  - Lai, Xin
JO  - Information and Software Technology
VL  - 190
