T1  - Usage patterns of software product metrics in assessing developers’ output: A comprehensive study
AU  - Chen, Wentao
AU  - Yu, Huiqun
AU  - Fan, Guisheng
AU  - Huang, Zijie
AU  - Liang, Yuguo
