T1  - Ethical and Regulatory Issues in Governing AI-Enabled Software as a Medical Device: A Scoping Review
AU  - Ahsan, Shaharyar
AU  - Obi, Vivian Annastasia Chinyem
AU  - Noor, Danish
AU  - Senibi, Ruth
AU  - Konwea, Stephen Chukwuemeka
AU  - Khalid, Hamza
AU  - Amir, Saira
