T1  - SpotChecker: a deep learning and language model-powered web application for intelligent leaf spot segmentation, quantification, and disease analytics in dogwood (Cornus spp.)
AU  - Rayamajhi, Aleena
AU  - Malik, Muneeb Elahi
AU  - Mahmud, Md Sultan
